  "tutorialStep1Title": "Welcome to Graph Coloring",
  "tutorialStep1Subtitle": "Mathematical Logic Puzzle",
  "tutorialStep1Description": "Graph Coloring is a logic puzzle based on graph theory. Your mission is to color every node in the network while strictly respecting connection rules and color inventory requirements.",
  "tutorialStep2Title": "Nodes & Connection Rules",
  "tutorialStep2Subtitle": "The Golden Rule of Coloring",
  "tutorialStep2Description": "• Nodes (Circles): Points on the board that need coloring.\n• Edges (Lines): Connections between two nodes. You can toggle colored lines using the toolbar icon (5 free turns daily).\n• Golden Rule: Two directly connected nodes can NEVER share the same color!",
  "tutorialValidLabel": "Valid",
  "tutorialValidDesc": "Different colors on adjacent nodes",
  "tutorialConflictLabel": "Conflict!",
  "tutorialConflictDesc": "Connected nodes cannot have same color",
  "tutorialStep3Title": "Select & Place Colors",
  "tutorialStep3Subtitle": "Two intuitive ways to play",
  "tutorialStep3Description": "• Tap-to-Select: Tap a color from the inventory at the bottom, then tap any node to place it.\n• Drag & Drop: Touch and drag a color ball directly onto the target node.\n• Remove Color: Tap an already colored node without selecting any color to return it to inventory.",
  "tutorialTapToSelectLabel": "Tap or Drag",
  "tutorialStep4Title": "Exact Color Inventory",
  "tutorialStep4Subtitle": "Every ball must be used",
  "tutorialStep4Description": "• Each level provides an exact number of balls for each color.\n• The number below each color shows remaining balls.\n• To win, you must place 100% of the required balls — no more, no less!",
  "tutorialInventoryGoalLabel": "Goal: Use all available balls (0 remaining)",
  "tutorialStep5Title": "Actions & Mistake Shields",
  "tutorialStep5Subtitle": "Undo, Hint, Restart & Shields",
  "tutorialStep5Description": "• Undo (1/level): Reverse your previous move. Allowed 1 time per level.\n• Hint (1/day): Reveals a guaranteed valid move. Watch ads for extra hints.\n• Restart: Reset board. Free if no balls placed; costs 1 Energy if balls were placed.\n• Mistake Shields (2 🛡️): You can make up to 2 mistakes before Game Over.\n• Colored Lines (5 turns/day): You have 5 free Colored Lines turns each day. When enabled, finishing a level (win or defeat) deducts 1 turn. When exhausted, watch an ad to unlock more.",
  "tutorialActionUndo": "Undo",
  "tutorialActionHint": "Hint",
  "tutorialActionRestart": "Restart",
  "tutorialActionShields": "Shields",
  "tutorialStep6Title": "Victory & Progression",
  "tutorialStep6Subtitle": "Solve puzzles and earn stars",
  "tutorialStep6Description": "To complete a level:\n1. All nodes are colored.\n2. No adjacent nodes share the same color.\n3. All color counts are exactly satisfied.\nEarn up to 3 Stars across 180 levels in 6 Chapters. Enjoy the game!",
